{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>A daughter of Betuel am I, son of Milcah whom she bore to Nahor.</b> She said to him in full, so to speak — to say: do not suppose that my father Betuel was born of a concubine, for he is a son of Milcah."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:35.163908536Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}